---
// Nenhuma lógica do servidor necessária
---

<section id="quem-sou" class="relative min-h-[56vh] lg:min-h-[70vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden pt-20 lg:pt-24">
  <img src="/images/transfer11.jpg" alt="Transfer na Serra Gaúcha" width="600" height="522" fetchpriority="high" class="mobile-hero-image" />
  <!-- Overlay escuro para melhor legibilidade -->
  <div class="hero-overlay absolute inset-0 z-10"></div>

<!-- Conteúdo -->
  <div class="hero-content relative z-20 container mx-auto px-4 pb-2 lg:pb-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center text-white">
      <!-- Título Principal -->
      <div class="space-y-4 lg:space-y-6 mb-6 lg:mb-8">
        <h1 class="hero-title">
          <span>Escolha o<br />destino.</span>
          <em>A Gramado Tchê<br />cuida do resto.</em>
        </h1>

        <p class="text-lg lg:text-2xl leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto text-gray-100 animate-zoom-in" style="animation-delay: 0.3s; opacity: 0;">
          Com a Gramado Tchê Turismo, você conhece Gramado, Canela, Bento Gonçalves, Nova Petrópolis e outros destinos incríveis do seu jeito.
          </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>

<div class="mobile-hero-actions">
  <div class="hero-category-links">
    <a href="/passeios">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 3v4m8-4v4M4 11h16m-11 4h2m3 0h2m-7 3h2"/></svg>
      <span><strong>Passeios e Transfer</strong><span>Escolha o passeio</span></span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/ingressos">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16v5a2 2 0 000 4v5H4v-5a2 2 0 000-4V5zM15 5v3m0 3v2m0 3v3"/></svg>
      <span><strong>Ingressos e Atrações</strong><span>Veja os ingressos</span></span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
    </a>
  </div>
  <div id="hero-service-search" class="hero-service-search">
    <label for="hero-search-input" class="sr-only">Pesquisar serviços</label>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="6"/><path d="m15 15 5 5"/></svg>
    <input id="hero-search-input" type="search" placeholder="Pesquisar serviços..." autocomplete="off" aria-controls="hero-search-results" />
    <div id="hero-search-results" class="hidden absolute top-full left-0 right-0 mt-2 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl shadow-xl max-h-72 overflow-y-auto text-left" aria-live="polite"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  /* Hero shared by mobile, tablet and desktop. */
  @media (min-width: 0px) {
    #quem-sou {
      min-height: 740px;
      min-height: max(650px, 84svh);
      padding: 160px 0 76px;
      align-items: flex-end;
    }
    .mobile-hero-image {
      display: block;
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: 48% center;
    }
    .hero-video, .hero-arrow, .hero-divider { display: none; }
    .hero-content { padding: 0 22px; }
    .hero-content > div { text-align: left; max-width: none; }
    .hero-overlay { background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(0 40 56 / 12%) 15%, rgb(0 40 56 / 45%) 50%, #002d3de8 100%); }
    .hero-content h1 { font-size: clamp(42px, 10vw, 58px); font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -1.5px; }
    .hero-title span, .hero-title em { display: block; }
    .hero-title em { color: #ff6b00; margin-top: 10px; font-style: italic; }
    .hero-content p { max-width: 420px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; }
    .hero-content p { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .hero-content .animate-zoom-in { animation: none; opacity: 1 !important; }
    .hero-content .space-y-4 { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .mobile-hero-actions {
      display: block;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 30;
      margin: -30px 16px 32px;
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      background: white;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgb(0 0 0 / 8%);
    }
    .hero-category-links { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .hero-category-links a { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 14px 6px; color: #00516b; }
    .hero-category-links a + a { border-left: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
    .hero-category-links svg { width: 40px; height: 48px; padding: 10px; background: #edf3f5; border-radius: 10px; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .hero-category-links strong { display: block; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; }
    .hero-category-links span span { display: block; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; margin-top: 4px; }
    .hero-category-links a > span:last-child { margin-left: auto; font-size: 22px; }
    .hero-service-search { position: relative; color: white; }
    .hero-service-search > svg { position: absolute; left: 18px; top: 20px; width: 20px; height: 20px; pointer-events: none; }
    .hero-service-search input { width: 100%; min-width: 0; height: 60px; padding: 14px 18px 14px 48px; border-radius: 16px; background: #00516b; color: white; font-size: 16px; }
    .hero-service-search input::placeholder { color: white; opacity: 1; }
    .hero-service-search input:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #84b795; outline-offset: 3px; }
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    #quem-sou { min-height: 760px; padding-bottom: 100px; }
    .hero-content { padding: 0 48px; }
    .hero-content h1 { font-size: clamp(58px, 6vw, 76px); }
    .hero-content p { font-size: 19px; max-width: 520px; }
    .mobile-hero-actions { max-width: 720px; margin: -44px auto 40px; padding: 16px; }
    .hero-category-links a { padding: 18px 14px; gap: 14px; }
    .hero-category-links strong { font-size: 12px; }
    .hero-category-links span span { font-size: 16px; }
    .hero-category-links svg { width: 48px; height: 48px; padding: 12px; }
  }
  @keyframes zoom-in {
    0% {
      transform: scale(1.2);
      opacity: 0;
    }
    100% {
      transform: scale(1);
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }

  .animate-zoom-in {
    animation: zoom-in 2s ease-out forwards;
    opacity: 0;
  }
</style>